    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD gets a Logo Upgrade</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Just in time for upcoming FreeCAD 1.0, the project got a major logo refresh.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;image-with-popover&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button aria-label=&#34;Zoom image&#34; popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img srcset=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/image-3_hu_9e9c7354c2051303.webp 500w, https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/image-3_hu_e3b158769f38bf75.webp 1000w, https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/image-3.png 1800w&#34;&#xA;            sizes=&#34;(max-width: 500px) 500px, (max-width: 1000px) 1000px, 75vw&#34;&#xA;            src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/image-3.png&#34;&#xA;            width=&#34;1800&#34;&#xA;            height=&#34;480&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;Image 3&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;Image 3&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Image 3&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div id=&#34;img-001&#34; popover&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-gets-a-logo-upgrade/image-3.png&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;Image 3&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;Image 3&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;button class=&#34;close&#34;&#xA;            popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&#xA;            popovertargetaction=&#34;hide&#34;&#xA;            aria-label=&#34;Close image viewer&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-cross&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M4 20 20 4M4 4 20 20&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To get there, the design working group organized a &lt;a href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org/viewtopic.php?t=87074&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;popularity contest&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Volunteers submitted 46 designs, over 1,500 community members voted for the TOP-5, then a team of maintainers voted for the winning entry among those five - the one submitted by syta.co (FreeCAD forum handle).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Vote for a new FreeCAD logo</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/vote-for-a-new-freecad-logo/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/vote-for-a-new-freecad-logo/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;There have been 46 submissions to the new FreeCAD logo contest. The user poll is closing on May 1 (this Wednesday). You can still &lt;a href=&#34;https://tally.so/r/n9dZVE&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;pick your top 5 entries&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The 5 winning submissions will then be submitted to the maintainers team for the final voting.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD 1.0 Logo Refresh Contest</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-1-0-logo-refresh-contest/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-1-0-logo-refresh-contest/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;With FreeCAD 1.0 on the horizon, it&amp;rsquo;s time to refresh the official FreeCAD logo. At the request of the project maintainers, the intent here is to follow a similar approach to corporate logos and evolve/iterate the current FreeCAD symbol instead of completely reinventing the symbology of it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FPA Needs a Logo</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-needs-a-logo/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Mar 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-needs-a-logo/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;The FreeCAD Project Association&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (FPA)&amp;rsquo;s Mission is to support and protect the FreeCAD project. As an organization independent of the community FreeCAD project, the FPA would like to have a logo that is visually distinct. To that end, last month &lt;a href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org/viewtopic.php?t=76211&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;we held open submissions for a new logo&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Over the last week, FPA members have been voting for their favorites, and we have it narrowed to five final candidates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FPA Logo Contest</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-logo-contest/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
